      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Talon stabs the target unit. If they are within melee range, this attack deals critical damage. If they are outside melee range, Talon will leap at his target before stabbing them. Talon refunds some health and cooldown if this ability kills the target.",
      "summary_zh": "泰隆戳刺目标单位。如果目标在近战距离之内，那么这次攻击会造成致命伤害。如果目标在近战距离之外，那么泰隆将会跃向他的目标然后戳刺目标。如果这个技能击杀了泰隆的目标，那么就会返还给泰隆一些生命值和冷却时间。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1309730:4015970"
      ]
    },
