      "summary_en": "Talon sends out a volley of daggers that then return back to him, dealing physical damage every time it passes through an enemy. The returning blades deal bonus damage and slow units hit.",
      "summary_zh": "泰隆放出一排匕首，随后匕首会返回泰隆处，匕首每次穿过敌人时都会造成物理伤害。返程的匕首会造成额外伤害并使被命中的目标减速。",
